 "answer": "原式\\(=\\dfrac{x+3}{x-2}\\)；\\(x=3\\)时，值为\\(6\\)",
 "methodPoints": [],
 "solution": "\\(1-\\dfrac{1}{x+3}=\\dfrac{x+2}{x+3}\\)。\n原式\\(=\\dfrac{x+2}{x+3}\\cdot\\dfrac{(x+3)^2}{(x+2)(x-2)}=\\dfrac{x+3}{x-2}\\)。\n\\(x=4\\times\\dfrac{1}{2}+1=3\\)，原式\\(=\\dfrac{3+3}{3-2}=6\\)。",
 "explanation": {
  "idea": "括号内先通分，除法变乘法并因式分解，约分后再代值。",
  "hints": [
   "\\(x^2-4\\)和\\(x^2+6x+9\\)分别能怎样分解？",
   "\\(\\cos 60^\\circ\\)等于多少？"
